# NUCESPOOL
## Product Requirements Document (PRD), User Requirements & Product Specifications

**Document Version:** 1.0  
**Product:** NUCESPOOL  
**Product Category:** Student Mobility, Ride-Sharing & Carpooling  
**Initial Institution:** FAST-NUCES Chiniot Campus  
**Initial Commuting Corridor:** Chiniot ↔ Faisalabad  
**Launch Platform:** Mobile-first web application / Progressive Web App (PWA)  
**Future Expansion:** Other campuses, universities, cities, and commuting routes  
